Calls carry video now, in a screen of their own with a tile per participant.
They work on servers that run separate signalling, a media server or a TURN
relay, not only on the built-in path. Screen sharing goes both ways, and a
network drop no longer ends the call. Breakout rooms and picture-in-picture
are new too.

Fixed: three crashes, the missing time on call entries, and a camera offered
to somebody whose moderator had turned it off.
